.TH LOOM 1 "2026-07-27" "loom 0.0.4" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
loom \- manage the workstation configuration
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B loom
.I command
.RI [ options ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B loom
is the single public command for installing, applying, checking, and maintaining this workstation configuration.
.PP
The command is installed in
.I ~/.local/bin
by the common profile. The repository's setup and apply operations use GNU Stow with dry-run and backup safeguards.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B setup
Install or update a profile. Passes installer options such as
.BR --local ,
.BR --profile ,
.BR --dry-run ,
and
.BR --no-backup .
.TP
.B apply
Apply packages from the existing checkout. With no package arguments, applies the selected profile; with package arguments, applies only those declared packages.
.TP
.B check
Run the installed-machine check and repository validation. Use
.BR --machine
or
.BR --repo
to select one scope.
.TP
.B desktop
Apply window-manager packages with smoke checks, confirmation, and last-known-good rollback. Use
.BR --yes
for non-interactive confirmation.
.TP
.B tools
Run
.BR loom\ tools\ install
or
.BR loom\ tools\ outdated .
.TP
.B profiles
Print supported profiles.
.TP
.B version
Print the checkout revision used by Loom.
.SH SAFETY
Always inspect a dry run before a broad apply. Loom refuses
.B --adopt
and limits packages to those listed in
.I packages.conf .
Desktop changes require a clean Git worktree and can roll back when smoke checks fail.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.dotfiles
Default checkout used by setup and apply.
.TP
.I ~/.local/bin/loom
Installed command.
.TP
.I ~/.local/share/man/man1/loom.1
This manual page.
.TP
.I ~/.stow-backup/
Backup location used by the installer for replaced files.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B DOTFILES_PROFILE
Default profile for checks and applies. Defaults to
.B common .
.TP
.B DOTFILES_DIR
Override the checkout used by
.B loom apply .
.TP
.B DOTFILES_ROOT
Override the checkout used by
.B loom desktop .
.TP
.B DOTFILES_WM_PACKAGES
Desktop packages to apply. Defaults to
.B mango waybar .
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
The requested operation completed successfully.
.TP
.B 2
Usage or argument error.
.TP
.B non-zero
A dependency, conflict, validation, or desktop safety check failed.
.SH EXAMPLES
Preview and install the shared profile:
.PP
.nf
loom setup --local --dry-run --profile common
loom setup --local --profile common
.fi
.PP
Apply one package safely:
.PP
.nf
loom apply --dry-run nvim
loom apply nvim
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR git (1),
.BR man (1),
.BR mise (1),
.BR stow (1)
